      "created_at": "2022-08-31T17:45:44Z",
      "updated_at": "2022-08-31T19:50:56Z",
      "body": "For text you could point the [text component](https://aframe.io/docs/1.3.0/components/text.html#properties_font) to an URL where you host fonts locally. \r\n\r\nFor the controllers the URL of the built-in models is not currently exposed in the [component schema](https://aframe.io/docs/1.3.0/components/oculus-touch-controls.html#value). \r\n\r\nIf you're offline I'm assuming you are not pulling A-Frame from the CDN but serving your own. You could create custom builds, modify the base URL from [oculus-touch-controls](https://github.com/aframevr/aframe/blob/master/src/components/oculus-touch-controls.js#L19) and serve the models locally.\r\n\r\n",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
